WEBVTT

00:16:26.232 --> 00:16:30.025
If online digital spaces
are going to be our new home,

00:16:30.049 --> 00:16:33.668
let's make them a comfortable,
beautiful place to live,

00:16:33.692 --> 00:16:35.994
a place we all feel not just included

00:16:36.018 --> 00:16:37.834
but actually some ownership of.

00:16:38.669 --> 00:16:40.488
A place we get to know each other.

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:44.573
A place you'd actually want
not just to visit

00:16:44.597 --> 00:16:46.037
but to bring your kids.

00:16:47.127 --> 00:16:48.286
Thank you.

00:16:48.310 --> 00:16:52.896
(Applause)